==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Brollow]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
J.J. Jackrabbit and Brollows are formidible for your basic labyrinth fodder. One might consider focusing on anti-Red fodder in the lineup or even a less useful attacker to ensure the Jackrabbits are dealt with every time.

